        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-2">
          <span class="font-extrabold text-rose-500 uppercase text-xs">❌ Before The Master Vault:</span>
          <p>
            "I used to track every receipt in an Etsy template with 18 tabs. It took 45 minutes every weekend, my husband hated it, and when the car alternator died in March, it blew up our entire budget. I felt guilty buying a $6 coffee."
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-2">
          <span class="font-extrabold text-emerald-500 uppercase text-xs">✅ With The Master Vault:</span>
          <p>
            "On the 1st of every month, I open the 2-Minute Quick Check on my laptop and enter 4 numbers. It shows me our net worth is in the top 18%, we have $1,400 in our car sinking fund, and our safe-to-spend buffer is $48/day. Zero guilt, zero stress."
